[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10262.83, "timestamp": "02:51:02", "text": "就是别搞Instagram直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10266.429, "timestamp": "02:51:06", "text": "完全同意，我会坚持下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10269.309, "timestamp": "02:51:09", "text": "通常情况下，YouTube、Twitch 和 V 都值得信赖。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10274.269, "timestamp": "02:51:14", "text": "暂时先用这个频道看看效果如何。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10277.19, "timestamp": "02:51:17", "text": "是啊，所以，我们只会那样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10279.309, "timestamp": "02:51:19", "text": "好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10282.59, "timestamp": "02:51:22", "text": "所以，谢谢大家的光临。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10285.03, "timestamp": "02:51:25", "text": "非常抱歉，我们这里停电了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10287.75, "timestamp": "02:51:27", "text": "我的直播不可用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10290.55, "timestamp": "02:51:30", "text": "待处理状态或类似加载状态"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10294.59, "timestamp": "02:51:34", "text": "比如说，3个小时？我很抱歉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10297.469, "timestamp": "02:51:37", "text": "那件事（指电力方面）出乎意料。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10300.349, "timestamp": "02:51:40", "text": "但没关系，事情就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10302.75, "timestamp": "02:51:42", "text": "嗯，明天我会和你们保持联系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10305.269, "timestamp": "02:51:45", "text": "发布明天要发生的事情，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10307.51, "timestamp": "02:51:47", "text": "是的，谢谢大家光临TOA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10309.07, "timestamp": "02:51:49", "text": "那是什么狗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10311.87, "timestamp": "02:51:51", "text": "祝你今晚睡个好觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10313.91, "timestamp": "02:51:53", "text": "如果是早上，那就是晚上或早上了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10317.95, "timestamp": "02:51:57", "text": "所以，祝你好运，也祝我好运。"}]